@startuml
title PayScale HTTPE - Batch Merchant Settlement Sequence (Up to 100,000 Transactions)

autonumber
actor "Settlement Cron" as Cron
control "Settlement Processing\nService" as SettleSvc
database "Read Replicas\n(Analytics Pool)" as Replica
database "Settlement Pool\nShard (Shard 0)" as PoolShard
database "Merchant Shards\n(Shards 1..3)" as MerchShards
queue "Kafka Topic\n(settlement-events)" as Kafka
boundary "Merchant Webhook" as Webhook

== Phase 1: Aggregation & Fee Calculation ==
Cron -> SettleSvc: Trigger Daily Batch Settlement (BatchId: BATCH-20261026-01)
SettleSvc -> Replica: SELECT merchant_id, SUM(amount), COUNT(*) FROM transactions\nWHERE type='MERCHANT_PAYMENT' AND settled=false GROUP BY merchant_id
Replica --> SettleSvc: 100,000 txns aggregated across 850 merchants

SettleSvc -> SettleSvc: Calculate MDR Fees & Net Payouts:\nNet = Gross - (Gross * 0.015 MDR) - Refunds
SettleSvc -> SettleSvc: Sort Merchants alphabetically by account_id\n(Enforce deadlock-free lock hierarchy)

== Phase 2: Batch Ledger Posting & Atomic Settlement ==
SettleSvc -> PoolShard: BEGIN TRANSACTION (Settlement Pool Shard)
SettleSvc -> PoolShard: UPDATE accounts SET available_balance = available_balance - BatchTotal,\nledger_balance = ledger_balance - BatchTotal WHERE account_id = 'POOL_SETTLEMENT_ACCOUNT'
PoolShard -> PoolShard: INSERT INTO ledger_entries (POOL_ACCOUNT, DEBIT, BatchTotal)

loop For Each Merchant Target Shard (Batch chunk = 500)
    SettleSvc -> MerchShards: BEGIN TRANSACTION
    SettleSvc -> MerchShards: UPDATE accounts SET available_balance = available_balance + NetPayout,\nledger_balance = ledger_balance + NetPayout WHERE account_id = MerchantAccountId
    MerchShards -> MerchShards: INSERT INTO ledger_entries (MerchantAccountId, CREDIT, NetPayout)
    MerchShards -> MerchShards: INSERT INTO ledger_entries (FEE_REVENUE_ACCOUNT, CREDIT, FeeTotal)
    MerchShards -> MerchShards: COMMIT
end

SettleSvc -> PoolShard: INSERT INTO merchant_settlements (batch_id, count=100000, total_amount, status='SETTLED')
SettleSvc -> PoolShard: COMMIT

== Phase 3: Event Emission & Webhook Delivery ==
SettleSvc -> Kafka: Produce Event: BATCH_SETTLEMENT_COMPLETED (BatchId, MerchSummary)
Kafka -> SettleSvc: Acknowledged (min.insync=2)

Kafka -> Webhook: Dispatched with HMAC-SHA256 Signature Header
Webhook --> Kafka: HTTP 200 OK (Settlement Acknowledged by Merchant POS)
@enduml
